# Diagnostic relocation-format control for SM-X710.
#
# Keep the s9u-va48 address geometry and relocatable kernel, but force all
# dynamic relative relocations to remain in RELA instead of packed RELR.
# This is intended to test the observed low __dyndbg pointer after runtime
# relocation without changing the compiler, DTS, or ARM64 VA/PA geometry.
# CONFIG_RELR is not set
